/**
 * @file
 * Intentionally empty placeholder.
 *
 * Drupal 11 loads only THEMENAME.theme for theme extensions — not this file.
 * Hook implementations here are not auto-loaded and are not included in hook
 * discovery (only installed modules in core.extension are). Use
 * THEMENAME.theme (preprocess / alter) or attach assets from a module, e.g.
 * myeventlane_commerce_page_attachments() for the booking summary library.
 */
